comment4.target=void shouldAddWheelAtStartIfPosTooLittle()
comment4.text=\r\n If we put a wheel in a position lower than the number of wheels it should be placed at the start.\r\n
comment5.target=void shouldWheelNumberBeLessIfWheelDeleted()
comment5.text=\r\n If a wheel is deleted, the number of wheels should be lower\r\n
